      "role": "user",
      "content": "the profiler isn't really a great option here because we're working with very limited resources on the actual hardware, so we can't really run valgrind on the target. can u suggest some ways i can track this down using manual instrumentation or better logging? also, what specific patterns should i be looking for in the heap usage over time that would indicate it's a slow leak vs just fragmentation?",
